---
import Slide from "../../components/Slide.astro"
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro"
import CentredImage from "../../components/CentredImage.astro"
import line_16 from "../../img/unity/line-16.jpg"
import hc_square from "../../img/unity/hc-square.png"
import hc_cube from "../../img/unity/hc-cube.png"
import hc_hypercube from "../../img/unity/hc-hypercube.png"
import hc_hypercube_colour from "../../img/unity/hc-hypercube-colour.png"
---
<Slide t2="Kick-off: Self Colouring by Tag">
    <ul>
        <li>Kick off with a brand new project</li>
        <li>Create a sphere prefab that colours itself on start</li>
        <li>(Make sure the scene has <code>A</code> and <code>B</code> tags)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="text-sm-2">
        <CodeBlock lang="csharp" height="250px">
            { `
void Start()
{
    Renderer renderer = GetComponent<Renderer>();

    if (CompareTag("A")) {
        renderer.material.color = Color.red;
    } else if (CompareTag("B")) {
        renderer.material.color = Color.black;
    } else {
        renderer.material.color = Color.white;
    }
}
            `.trim() }
        </CodeBlock>
    </div>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Spawner">
    <div class="text-sm-2">
        <CodeBlock lang="csharp" height="400px">
            { `
public class SphereLayoutSpawner : MonoBehaviour
{
    public GameObject spherePrefab;
    const int NUM_SPHERES = 16;

    private Vector3 spawnPosition(int index) {
        ... return new Vector3(...) ...
    }

    private void assignTag(int index, GameObject g) {
        ... g.tag = ...
    }

    void Start()
    {
        for (int i = 0; i < NUM_SPHERES; i++) {
            Vector3 pos = spawnPosition(i);
            GameObject g = Instantiate(spherePrefab, pos, spherePrefab.transform.rotation);
            assignTag(i, g);
        }
    }
}
            `.trim() }
        </CodeBlock>
    </div>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Exercise">
    <ul class="text-sm-1">
        <li class="fragment">Row of spheres along X axis</li>
        <li class="fragment">Camera aimed at <code>(0, 0, 0)</code></li>
        <li class="fragment">Uniformly random colours (3-way choice)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="fragment">
        <CentredImage src={ line_16 } size={ [600] } />
    </div>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="More Exercise: Colour Changes">
    <ul class="text-sm-1">
        <li class="fragment">Cycle: 🔴⚪️⚫️🔴⚪️⚫️🔴⚪️⚫️🔴⚪️⚫️🔴⚪️⚫️🔴</li>
        <li class="fragment">Ends and middle: 🔴⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚫️⚫️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️⚪️🔴</li>
        <li class="fragment">Half-random: 🔴🔴🔴🔴🔴🔴🔴🔴⚫️⚪️⚫️⚪️⚫️⚫️⚪️⚪️</li>
    </ul>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="More Dimensions">
    <p>This is a square lying flat (<code>X</code> and <code>Z</code> axes):</p>

    <div class="text-sm-1">
        <CodeBlock lang="csharp" height="250px">
            { `
private Vector3 spawnPositionSquare(int index) {
    int dist = 2;   //  Distance along axis.
    // x alternates between -ve and +ve distance:
    int x = (index % 2 == 0) ? dist : -dist;
    // z alternates at half the rate:
    int z = ((index / 2) % 2 == 0) ? dist : -dist;

    return new Vector3(x, 0, z);
}
            `.trim() }
        </CodeBlock>
    </div>
</Slide>

<Slide>
    <CentredImage src={ hc_square } size={ [600] } />
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Third Dimension">
    <p>Can you bring in the <code>Y</code> dimension to make a cube?</p>

    <CentredImage src={ hc_cube } size={ [600]} />
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Fourth Dimension">
    <p>Can you bring in the fourth dimension to make a hypercube (projection)?</p>

    <CentredImage src={ hc_hypercube } size={ [400, 400] } />

    <p class="fragment">Aside: how many corners, edges, faces, cubes in a hypercube?</p>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Colouring">
    <ul class="text-sm-1">
        <li class="fragment">So far, our colouring (by tag) is random</li>
        <li class="fragment">Adapt to switch between two colours <em>exactly</em>
            as we switch between -ve and +ve coordinates</li>
        <li class="fragment">What sets of points are being highlighted?</li>
        <li class="fragment">Can you complete the set?</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="fragment">
        <CentredImage src={ hc_hypercube_colour } size={ [500]} />
    </div>
</Slide>
